// On `Ping`, whose principals are `OAuthUser`s and `Bot`s, `principal` is given to a field that
// holds an `OAuthUser`. In the request environment of a `Bot`, the specification rejects it
// (predicate arguments).
permit (principal, action == Drupe::Action::"Ping", resource)
when temporal {
    formerly within 1h Drupe::Action::"Ping"::request{ input.owner: principal }
};
